## Choose a market

Open **Markets**, select the asset you want to trade, and choose **Trade**. Connect your wallet when prompted.

## Choose an order type

- **Market** executes immediately against available on-chain liquidity, subject to the quoted price and slippage limit.
- **Limit** publishes an on-chain order that can be filled when liquidity reaches your chosen price.
- **DCA** publishes a recurring on-chain strategy using the schedule and amount you configure.

Market orders can fail when sufficient liquidity is not available. Review the quote before confirming the transaction.

Limit and DCA orders use self-custodial orderbook vaults. You can monitor fills and manage deployed orders from the orders table on the market page. Withdraw completed-order assets from your vault when you want them back in your wallet.
